# secrets
.env

# Run output. Ignored by default because in production it would carry captured page state;
# every run here is against the synthetic harness, so a named set is committed as the
# deliverable. Anchored to the repo root: an unanchored "evidence/" also matches
# src/cua/evidence/ and silently drops the package.
#
# `/evidence/*` rather than `/evidence/` so the negations below can re-include specific
# entries - git cannot un-ignore anything inside a directory it has excluded outright.
/evidence/*
!/evidence/README.md
!/evidence/*.txt
# One discovery run: the trace, the accessibility snapshots the model reasoned over, the
# screenshots, and the draft artifact it emitted.
!/evidence/discovery-20260910T211157-fb8cb8/
# One replay per outcome class, which is the distinction the whole result contract exists for.
!/evidence/replay-business-not-found/
!/evidence/replay-recoverable-modal/
!/evidence/replay-hard-failure-permission/
# The escalation transfer: the intervention raised, the lock handed over, what the human did,
# and the checkpoint re-verified on resume. Escalation is a core requirement and this is its
# only demonstration, so it should not be the one run a reviewer cannot open.
!/evidence/handoff-live-demo/
# The stability measurement the README quotes, and the drift verdict derived from it. The
# directory is re-included and then re-emptied so only these two are published.
!/evidence/stability/
/evidence/stability/*
!/evidence/stability/replay-x10.json
!/evidence/stability/drift-x10.json

# browser artifacts
.playwright/
playwright-report/
test-results/
*.webm
*.trace.zip
/screenshots/

# python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
*.egg-info/
/build/
/dist/

# tool caches
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/

# uiautomation drops this next to the cwd on every run.
@AutomationLog.txt
